- A non-zero exit (interface response `'1': Invalid arguments`) surfaces as a step error carrying stderr, instead of being mistaken for a value.
- `exec.Command` is left with the inherited environment — no `cmd.Env` assignment — so the ambient `GOCACHE`/`TMPDIR` the engine provides are preserved and no separate build cache is created.
